| Reconstructing or handing off a ticket | `.claude/skills/handoff-protocol.md` |
{% if has_test_repo %}
| Resolving any test section path | `.claude/references/test-sections.md` |
| Which mapped cases are automated | `.claude/references/automation-coverage.md` |
{% endif %}
