## 7. Adding New Tests

1. Add the capability to `specs/<domain>.md` — status ❌
2. Add the row to `COVERAGE.md`
3. Write the test with two tags: `domain` + `feature-slug`
{% if has_test_repo %}
4. Tag the test with the {{ test_repo_label }} case ID (e.g. `@C12345`)
{% else %}
4. Add the Gherkin / test body referencing the acceptance criteria
{% endif %}
5. Flip spec row and `COVERAGE.md` row to ✅ after the test passes CI
6. Validate with dry-run before committing

