## 8. Coverage Sync (mandatory after every task that creates or automates a case)

After every task: update `COVERAGE.md`, update `specs/<domain>.md`{% if doc_platform != 'none' %}, sync {{ doc_label }}{% endif %}.
A task is not done until all sources agree.

